\subsection*{Dark Sector Action}

Cold dark matter is modeled as a pressureless fluid:

\[
S_{\text{DM}}
=
\int d^4x \sqrt{-g}\,
\rho_{\text{DM}}(x).
\]

Einasto profile:
\[
\rho_{\text{DM}}(r)
=
\rho_0
\exp\left[
-\frac{2}{\alpha}
\left(
\left(\frac{r}{r_{-2}}\right)^\alpha - 1
\right)
\right].
\]

Mass integral:
\[
M(r)
=
4\pi
\int_0^r
r'^2
\rho_{\text{DM}}(r')
dr'.
\]

Circular velocity:
\[
v_c(r)
=
\sqrt{\frac{GM(r)}{r}}.
\]

RAR constraint:
\[
g_{\text{obs}}(r)
=
\frac{v_c^2(r)}{r}.
\]

