\subsection*{Multiverse Decoherence Action}

The multiverse subsystem is governed by a Lindblad-modified quantum action:

\[
S_{\text{multi}}
=
\int dt\,
\left[
\bra{\Psi}
i\hbar\frac{d}{dt}
-
\hat{H}
\ket{\Psi}
\right]
+
S_{\text{Lindblad}}.
\]

Lindblad term:
\[
S_{\text{Lindblad}}
=
\int dt\,
\sum_k
\left(
L_k \rho L_k^\dagger
-
\frac{1}{2}
\{L_k^\dagger L_k, \rho\}
\right).
\]

Norm clamp:
\[
\rho
\to
\frac{\rho}{\mathrm{Tr}(\rho)}.
\]

Decoherence functional:
\[
D(\alpha,\beta)
=
\mathrm{Tr}
\left(
C_\alpha \rho_0 C_\beta^\dagger
\right).
\]

