\subsection*{Spin-2 Graviton Action}

Linearized Einstein-Hilbert action:
\[
S_{\text{grav}}
=
\frac{1}{64\pi G}
\int d^4x
\left[
\partial_\lambda h_{\mu\nu}
\partial^\lambda h^{\mu\nu}
-
2\partial_\mu h^{\mu\nu}
\partial^\lambda h_{\lambda\nu}
+
2\partial_\mu h^{\mu\nu}
\partial_\nu h
-
\partial_\lambda h
\partial^\lambda h
\right].
\]

Gauge transformation:
\[
h_{\mu\nu}
\to
h_{\mu\nu}
-
\partial_\mu \xi_\nu
-
\partial_\nu \xi_\mu.
\]

Wave equation:
\[
\square h_{\mu\nu} = 0.
\]

FLRW propagation:
\[
\ddot{h}_{\mu\nu}
+
3H\dot{h}_{\mu\nu}
+
\frac{k^2}{a^2}h_{\mu\nu}
=
0.
\]

Polarizations:
\[
h_+, \quad h_\times.
\]

Ghost-free condition:
\[
h^\mu_{\ \mu} = 0.
\]

